ww.youtube.com/watch?v=oLC49nCf0ZM"}]},{"kind":"podcast","title":"Diverse Influences and Comparisons","body":"The album's sound has been compared to the aggressive styles of Courtney Love and PJ Harvey, the introspective nature of classic singer-songwriters, and the depressive undertones of Lou Reed, all integrated into a unified whole. \"a veces nos recuerda pues ese toque tan duro y tan agresivo pues que podía tener corny lozo que podía tener cuña adrina a veces nos recuerda caja una canta autora clásica a veces tiene ese toque tan depresivo que podría tener incluso lurrid.\"","year":null,"extra":null,"srcs":[{"source":"Music Radar Clan","episode":"Mejores discos del 2017","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=T34CwsFmXpI"}]},{"kind":"podcast","title":"Inspiring Young Musicians","body":"Ellie actively inspires young women to play guitar; for example, at one gig, a 15-year-old girl named Jade played her guitar part on stage and \"wowed the audience.\" Rowsell notes that every night, a young woman approaches her, crediting her for inspiring them to pick up the guitar. \"And so when Gignette came around, a 15-year-old girl named Jade came up on stage, took Ellie's guitar and wowed the audience. ... Ellie says that every night some young woman comes up to her and says, hey, it's because of you I'm playing the guitar.\"","year":null,"extra":null,"srcs":[{"source":"The Ongoing History of New Music","episode":"Modern Guitar Heroes 2: The Women","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oLC49nCf0ZM"}]}],"awards":[],"concerts":[],"xref":[],"charts":[{"id":197688580267938,"type":"album","name":"My Love is Cool","list_id":84472050122582,"list":"AOTY Must Hear 2010s","src":"musthear","rank":496,"year":2015,"note":null,"yt":"NQNBJwScN1A","scaruffi":null},{"id":43462686310897,"type":"album","name":"Visions of a Life","list_id":84472050122582,"list":"AOTY Must Hear 2010s","src":"musthear","rank":255,"year":2017,"note":null,"yt":"Y88AiJqPAfw","scaruffi":null},{"id":43462686310897,"